(i)  GBP 80,600 (eighty thousand six hundred pounds sterling) for pecuniary damage to be held by the applicant for his brother Abdüllatif İlhan;

(ii)  GBP 25,000 (twenty-five thousand pounds sterling) for non-pecuniary damage, which sum is to be held by the applicant for his brother Abdüllatif İlhan;

